  "source_sha256": "86bd0a350104559bab1403177e819bd5f1fc98840b5abeb6cc9f41bb15824f90",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "32b6412358398184e13848f4ae807c9175961663d238691d35e07557af0e1bca",
      "text": "Wukong Visits\nthe Pumpkin Patch",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0cde9ffe913019af57a4247ec6ea46638a141a8e726423a17832d65e478da2d1",
      "text": "Wukong, Ao Bing and Nezha\nvisit the farm.\nTall corn grows all around.\n“It is a corn maze!”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f9eeeae5df9e9f07c33704483b64a5e955dd1e9ff4d459f0f0d335c0e5856f8c",
      "text": "Tang Monk points\nto the maze.\n“The pumpkin field\nis at the end.\nTurn left at the scarecrow.\nTurn right at the pumpkins.”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f7be856226c42b253c9a273cb6b8204fb5807bbb5a5f6e9f528b20b7b32bf5d8",
      "text": "Nezha runs in first.\nHe turns right, then left,\nthen right again.\n“This way!” he shouts.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5324dfeda22fc136d991c5870f3786d4c913f2cf3872341ef961360b50676531",
      "text": "They run around and around.\nThen they pop out…\nright back at the start!\n“Hello again!” says Tang Monk.\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6bb3bae2c4fcd451a29488e0ee8196daf38a25a4954ced9eeae4eb6f6078824",
      "text": "Ao Bing has an idea.\n“Let’s look for the clues.”\nThey go straight in\nand walk slowly.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1a1b7666af9738eea5466c6804f49054162e19f438f7e9ec7921e67cd2e3a8ca",
      "text": "A scarecrow is\nin front of them.\n“Turn left at the scarecrow,”\nsays Wukong.\nThey all turn left.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "27780f12d914bb6468b2840969a7c10744a1a679a1d356e0e3e1ad2aaeda23cd",
      "text": "Corn on the left.\nCorn on the right.\nThe path goes between them.\n“Go straight,” says Ao Bing.\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8ce878f33884dd2ba3a0471e1af2b6921d5cd812a5b270cc0d0b0f139ad362b6",
      "text": "A little red tractor\nis next to the path.\n“Is this the pumpkin pile?”\nasks Nezha.\n“No, it’s a tractor!”\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef1826ead0e52ba6b48ea0cbc4f6efd6c217d91ffc7e3ca5584fdb57c5b1bf34",
      "text": "Behind the tractor,\nthey find a pumpkin pile.\n“Turn right at the pumpkins!”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6afec40ea537d9e795699d00e44e74e66d475af49b362e6172d9ee7f21eb9f1e",
      "text": "Nezha wants to go left.\nHe stops and listens.\nThen he turns right\nwith his friends.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6dfeb80901b294ddedb7db40dc1ec19e5d8e966fb3d516793e90b1edb5409ea8",
      "text": "The path bends\naround a corner.\nThey hear laughing\nin front of them.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "95147f7fafaaa64c1cad8cca43ec1a8196c6a5fa4775cc4491fb564d73271f37",
      "text": "Wukong peeks\nbetween two corn stalks.\nOrange! Orange everywhere!\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1de3e160106eb1c1d3efa2efaf32fdfab20a6585674a0173aa1f0113afaa9404",
      "text": "They come out\ninto the pumpkin field.\n“We did it!”\nThe maze is behind them now.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "41579201bf67eba2952d8182e9feca31b230fbd2a1aed5577bcfe2e7b4be637c",
      "text": "Wukong picks one\nnext to a big leaf.\nAo Bing picks one\nbetween two vines.\nNezha picks one\nbehind a scarecrow.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1c42e7fd867c651f105799a6135e7bee87236efbcab005b0cb8d5e0dd850e222",
      "text": "On the hay wagon,\nthe pumpkins sit in a row.\n“Which way is home?”\nasks Tang Monk.\n“Straight!” say the friends.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
